# Disposable local tooling and working files. The repo is PUBLIC, and this is
# where throwaway SQL, dumps and one-off scripts land — including things that
# query the cloud database. Nothing here is ever part of the product.
scratchpad/

# A local Remotion experiment (marketing video), created 2026-08-06. Founder
# ruling 2026-08-07: "leave the studio alone partner it was just a test".
#
# ⚠️ IGNORED HERE **AND** EXCLUDED FROM pnpm-workspace.yaml, and it needs both.
# `apps/*` made it a workspace package, so every `pnpm install` absorbed it into
# pnpm-lock.yaml — about 1,200 lines of video toolchain, one `git add -A` away
# from landing in the API's lockfile. Ignoring it alone would have hidden that
# from `git status` while leaving the lockfile damage in place.
#
# To bring it back into the project: delete this rule AND the negation in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml. The folder itself is untouched either way.
apps/studio/
